      "decision": "edit",
      "reason": "The speeding threshold must be converted from 30.0 m/s to 108.0 kph (30.0 * 3.6) and use strict greater-than comparison (> 108.0) on the decoded speed_kph value, preserving the vehicle_id and speeding decisions on adopted cases."
    }
